# Documentation stays current (iOS)

When you change user-facing or contract-facing behavior:

1. Update the matching guide in the same change:
   - `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/KB_APP_API_CONTRACT.md`, `docs/UI.md`
   - `docs/FASTLANE.md` / `docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md` if release/CI changed
2. If a guide is missing, add a short follow-up under `docs/todo.md` — do not silently skip.
3. Prefer moving finished task specs to `docs/tasks/completed/` over leaving stale “In progress” in `pending/`.
4. Do not revive Telegram-bot-primary wording as the app’s main story.
